== Walkthrough ==

{{expand}}

This quest will result in the three rings required for the [[Paw of Opolla Quest]]. [[Melixis]] is a merchant that sells supplies for shaman-made potions.


When you hail her she claims to have three [shiny tings] that she found all over the world. These shiny things are [a dull ring] a [kinda shiny ring] and a [really shiny ring].

* For the 'dull ring' ([[Copper Ring (Ring of Opolla)]]) she wants a [[Guk Bracket Mildew]].  
* For the 'kinda shiny ring' ([[Silver Ring (Ring of Opolla)]]) she wants [[Faerix Spores]].  
* For the 'really shiny ring' ([[Gold Ring (Ring of Opolla)]]) she wants some [[Degenerated Guk Weed]].

All of these items drop off the [[A Fungus Mutant]] in [[Upper Guk]]. 

You say, 'Hail Melixis'

:Melixis says, 'Welcome to Melixis shop.Rrrr. Feel free to brrrowse through my wares.  Melixis also find some [shiny tings] that she may trade you.'
You say, 'what shiny tings'
:Melixis says, 'In Melixis travels of the Odus, she find a [dull ring], a [kinda shiny ring] and a [really shiny ring]. Maybe you want to trade for those tings. Rrrr.'
You say, 'what dull ring'
:Melixis says, 'For dat ting? You brrring Melixis some bracket mildew. Rarr.'
:Melixis says, 'Many thanks.. rrrr.. here is dull ring.'

{{exp}}

You say, 'what kinda shiny ring'
:Melixis says, 'Hmm Hamed need faerix spores forrr potion. Rrrrr. You bring some to Melixis and she gives you the kinda shiny ring.'
:Melixis says, 'Melixis thanks you, Hamed will be pleased. A kinda shiny ring is yours.'

{{exp}}

You say, 'what really shiny ring'
:Melixis says, 'You go find degenerated guk weed. Melixis gives you the really shiny ring.'
:Melixis says, 'You done good job, furless one. Here is really shiny ring. Rarr..'

